  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Integration in Private Sector Development programmes activities</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender Integration in Private Sector Development programmes activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">In 2017, the Embassy of Sweden in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania decided to put a strong focus on integrating gender in non-social sectors with a focus on Private sector development /Agribusiness partners. The aim of this contribution is to continue providing gender integration support to strengthen the work and results of five partners in agricultural value chains in Tanzania.</narrative>
